WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.167
The study guide holds the why.

00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:03.972
The video shows the move.

00:00:03.972 --> 00:00:04.695
Use both.

00:00:04.695 --> 00:00:07.945
This lesson is about study guide + video pairing.

00:00:07.945 --> 00:00:10.112
Book holds why; video shows move.

00:00:10.112 --> 00:00:12.640
Do not treat this as theory only.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:16.251
Treat it as a move you can run this week.

00:00:16.251 --> 00:00:21.668
By the end, you should be able to act without waiting for a perfect plan.

00:00:21.668 --> 00:00:25.640
Keep the DigProg habit: watch, practice, then take one real action.

